+# v1.10.15 — Independent tc/SQM speed limits
+
+- Speed limits are now independent from Podkop nft/firewall tables.
+- Added hotplug re-apply hooks after interface/firewall/Podkop-related reloads.
+- Added CLI command: `/usr/bin/podkop-telegram-agent speed-apply`.
+- Service now starts explicitly as `podkop-telegram-agent run`.
+- While speed limits are active, the bot disables software/hardware flow offload so tc limits cannot be bypassed.
+- Obsolete nft speed limiter tables from v1.10.12/v1.10.13 are still cleaned automatically.
+- Visible version: `Podkop Telegram Agent v1.10.15`.
